sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway<br/>(data-science-gateway)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Authorino as Kuadrant/Authorino<br/>AuthPolicy
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Backend as Model Backend<br/>(KServe / ExternalModel)

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/model:predict<br/>Auth: API key / OIDC JWT / Bearer
    Gateway->>Authorino: AuthPolicy evaluation
    Authorino->>MaaSAPI: POST /internal/v1/api-keys/validate<br/>(callback, no auth, NetworkPolicy-restricted)
    MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: Validation result
    Authorino->>Gateway: Authorization header stripped
    Gateway->>Backend: Forward request<br/>Per-model credential injection<br/>HTTPS/TLS

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 2: API Key Lifecycle

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/api-keys<br/>Auth: Bearer token<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Gateway->>Authorino: AuthPolicy evaluation
    Authorino-->>Gateway: Identity validated
    Gateway->>MaaSAPI: Forward (header stripped)<br/>HTTP/8080
    MaaSAPI->>PostgreSQL: Store/query API key<br/>TCP/5432<br/>Auth: maas-db-config secret
    PostgreSQL-->>MaaSAPI: Key data
    MaaSAPI->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SAR<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>MaaSAPI: Auth result
    MaaSAPI-->>Gateway: API key response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 3: Tenant Bootstrapping

    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant Controller as maas-controller

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create AITenant CR<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>Auth: Admin credentials
    K8sAPI->>Controller: AITenant watch event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create namespace, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicies, MaasTenantConfig
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Deploy maas-api<br/>(kustomize render)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Kuadrant AuthPolicy<br/>(with header stripping)
